  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — completes the WebSocket subscription surface with two new IAsyncEnumerable streams: SubscribeSlotsUpdatesAsync (slotsUpdatesSubscribe — the full slot lifecycle: shreds received, bank created, frozen with per-slot transaction stats, optimistic confirmation, root, dead) and SubscribeVotesAsync (voteSubscribe — gossip votes before they land in a block; the node must run with --rpc-pubsub-enable-vote-subscription). Both are marked unstable by Solana. New models: SlotsUpdate, SlotsUpdateStats, VoteNotification. No breaking changes. Changelog: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
